WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:03.879
Okay, here we go!
Hey, palsies!

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:06.089
My name's Cody,
and I'm a Helpster.

00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:08.342
That means a monster who helps.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:11.762
And because I love, love, love
to help people so much,

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.722
I'm making these videos called...

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:22.189
If you know me,
you know I love to make a plan.

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:25.150
It's the best way to figure out
how to do something.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:27.027
But guess what?

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.071
Sometimes something happens,

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:32.950
and you have to
change your plan. Mm-hmm.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.953
Like today, I was supposed to go
to the park to see my favorite tree,

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.081
a cherry blossom tree.
Except I found out...

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:40.916
♪ Bum-bum-bum ♪

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:44.336
The park is closed.

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:46.964
Aah! I know, right?

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.466
But then I asked myself,
"Hey, Cody."

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:50.843
"Yes, Cody?"

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:52.803
"Is there another way to see
your favorite tree?"

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.012
"Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:00:54.096 --> 00:00:56.515
What if you
made your favorite tree?"

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.642
"You mean like
out of paper and stuff?"

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.893
"Yes, I do."

00:00:59.977 --> 00:01:01.103
"I love that idea!"

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:02.604
"Thank you so much."
"Yes!"

00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:04.481
"You're great."
"You're great too."

00:01:04.565 --> 00:01:06.525
Ha! So, that is the new goal:

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:08.944
Make my favorite tree
so I can see it.

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.863
Job one: Get paper.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:14.783
Mm-hmm. Job one done. Ding!

00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:17.661
Job two: Cut the paper
into the shapes I need.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.538
Cut, cut, cut, cut, cut, cut,
cut, cut, cut, cut!

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:21.123
Oh, by the way, if you do this,

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:22.791
make sure you get a grown-up
to help you, 'kay?

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:27.713
Cut, cut, cut, cut, cut,
and job two done. Ding!

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:31.633
And the third and final job:
Glue it all together.

00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:33.510
♪ Hm, hm, hm, hm, hm, hm, hm ♪

00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:35.304
♪ Glue, glue, glue, glue,
glue, glue, glue ♪

00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:37.973
Okay, looks like
all the jobs are done, mm,

00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:42.102
because... here is my tree!

00:01:42.186 --> 00:01:44.855
Oh, it is so beautiful
and life-like.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:47.608
And you know,
if I use my imagination,

00:01:47.691 --> 00:01:50.819
I can almost smell
the cherry blossoms.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.614
Ahh!

00:01:53.697 --> 00:01:57.075
You know, you can do almost
anything if you use your imagination.

00:01:57.659 --> 00:02:01.079
You can even imagine yourself
in different places like...

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:02.998
Antarctica.

00:02:04.291 --> 00:02:06.877
Whoa! Will you look at that?

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:10.756
Oh, hey! Hey, I'm gonna go play
with those penguins over there,

00:02:10.839 --> 00:02:12.424
but I'll be back real soon.

00:02:12.508 --> 00:02:14.259
And until then,
see what you can do

00:02:14.343 --> 00:02:16.386
to help the people
and the monsters around you.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:19.723
Because everyone loves
a helping hand. Bye!

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.266
Hey, wait for me!

